'COMMENT' QUOTE STROPPING, AS ON MANY MACHINES OF THE 1960S. THE WORD
  DELIMITERS ARE IN QUOTES, AND SPACES ARE IGNORED OUTSIDE STRINGS, SO
  AN IDENTIFIER MAY CONTAIN THEM, AS IN THE REFERENCE LANGUAGE;
'BEGIN'
  'INTEGER' NUMBER OF TERMS, K;
  'INTEGER' 'PROCEDURE' FACTORIAL(N); 'VALUE' N; 'INTEGER' N;
    FACTORIAL := 'IF' N 'LE' 1 'THEN' 1 'ELSE' N * FACTORIAL(N - 1);
  NUMBER OF TERMS := 10;
  'FOR' K := 1 'STEP' 1 'UNTIL' NUMBEROFTERMS 'DO'
    OUTINTEGER(1, FACTORIAL(K));
  OUTSTRING(1, "\n")
'END'
